WEBVTT

00:00:03.181 --> 00:00:04.803
Numbers come first.

00:00:04.803 --> 00:00:09.021
Open Interaction Center, Management, Omnichannel Addresses.

00:00:09.021 --> 00:00:13.759
Each address is one phone number your business owns, such as a main

00:00:13.759 --> 00:00:15.641
line or a support line.

00:00:16.132 --> 00:00:18.730
Click Add to see how a number is made.

00:00:18.730 --> 00:00:21.210
Give it a Name and the Phone number.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:25.579
Under Used for, tick Voice calls for a number that takes calls, Text

00:00:25.579 --> 00:00:28.472
messages for one that takes texts, or both.

